{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 and ResNet50 encoders with avgpool aggregation, comparing it to concatenation fusion (config_030). The validation accuracy of 0.6776 and F1 of 0.6464 suggest weighted fusion may improve performance in this configuration. However, the role of encoder choices or aggregation remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative design variations."
}

